# NOTE: do not add a blanket "results/" rule here. This repo's results/
# folder (see README) is meant to hold only the six small, final CSV
# tables listed in the README -- add exactly those files by hand rather
# than copying your local results/ directory wholesale, since that local
# folder also contains large intermediate files (radiomics_features.csv,
# PNGs, etc.) that should not be committed.

